OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer relives race to
OL,4,Asave trapped driver
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer who dragged an
OL,7,Funconscious woman from an overturned
OL,8,Fcar after she was trapped by her
OL,9,Fseatbelt and unable to breathe has
OL,10,Fspoken of the moment a doctor told her:
OL,11,F"If you hadn't cut her down, she would
OL,12,Fhave died."
OL,14,FPC Rebecca Edwards has been given a
OL,15,FRoyal Humane Society Resuscitation
OL,16,FCertificate for her actions at the
OL,17,Fcrash scene between Ombersley and
OL,18,FDroitwich, Worcestershire, in January.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
