OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer relives race to
OL,4,Asave trapped driver
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe officer, who has worked for West
OL,7,FMercia Police for 20 years, was on
OL,8,Fpatrol with a colleague when they got
OL,9,Fan automatic SOS alert from a vehicle
OL,10,Finvolved in the crash.
OL,12,F"We just headed towards it not knowing
OL,13,Fwhat was going to happen or what we
OL,14,Fwere going to come face to face with,"
OL,15,Fshe said.
